# 🚗 EV Market 2026 – Power BI Dashboard

## 📊 Project Overview

An interactive Electric Vehicle Market Analysis Dashboard created using Microsoft Power BI.

The dashboard provides insights into EV sales, pricing, battery capacity, driving range, brands, market segments, body types, and customer ratings.

## 📈 Dashboard Features

- Total Annual Sales
- Average Price
- Average Range
- Average Battery Capacity
- Customer Rating
- Annual Sales Trend
- Top Brands by Sales
- Market Segment Analysis
- Body Type Analysis
- Battery Capacity vs Range
- Interactive slicers
- Dynamic KPI cards
- Cross-filtering

## 🎛️ Interactive Filters

The dashboard includes filters for:

- Year
- Brand
- Market Segment
- Country
- Body Type
- Drive Type
- Variant

The visuals and KPI cards dynamically update when filters are applied.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX
- Power Query
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization

